[h1]Change Log:[/h1]
See the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/changelog/$item-id$]Change Notes on the workshop page[/url].

[h1]Compatibility:[/h1]
[list]
 [*]Achievement Compatible.
 [*]Fully save game compatible.
 [*]Should work with any mod. (If you are using my Improved Subject Management mod, load it before/above Rename Any Country; otherwise, you will only be able to rename subjects.)
 [*]I may add compatibility patches upon request.
 [*]The mod will [b]not[/b] work in ironman or multiplayer games.
[/list]

In addition to the comment section, you can also ask any questions, report bugs, or make suggestions by pinging @arealconner in the [url=https://discord.gg/zeQ6x9wrPq]#utility-mods channel of the EU5 Community discord server[/url]. And if you are interested in joining in the development of this or one of my other mods, you can ping or add me on Discord @arealconner. All contributions are welcome.

The source and dev versions of the mod are available on [url=https://github.com/conner-olsen/eu5-rename-any-country]GitHub.[/url]

